{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23494","headline":"酬皇甫庶子见寄 · 白居易","name":"酬皇甫庶子见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掌纶不称吾应笑，典郡无能我自知。\n别诏忽惊新命出，同寮偶与夙心期。\n春坊潇洒优闲地，秋鬓苍浪老大时。\n独占二疏应未可，龙楼见拟觅分司。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}